	<ImageDef locationName="productImage" file="./images/fireStopSealant.png"/>
	<P paraDef="Heading1">APPLICATION and USAGE</P>
	<P paraDef="Body">Sputnik pencils may be used just as well during space odessys
as during voyages 20 000 leagues below the surface of the sea even if the
writing surface is soaked.
</P>
	<P paraDef="Heading1">DESCRIPTION</P>
	<P paraDef="Body">The writing element is manufactured using the purest graphite
made from seal-wood charcoal and provides endless flexibility, durability and endurance.
</P>
	<P paraDef="Bulleted">Graphite purity: 77%</P>
	<P paraDef="Bulleted">Writing noise level: 8dB</P>
	<P paraDef="Body">The Sputnik is guarantee for up to 950 km of writing.
No toxic or other detectable fumes are emitted when using the Sputnik pencil.</P>
	<P paraDef="Body">SPUTNIK PENCIL conforms with Nordic NS-1322a standard</P>
	<P paraDef="Body">SPUTNIK PENCIL conforms with EU EIN-09348 (2032) standard</P>
	<P paraDef="Heading1">INSTRUCTIONS</P>
	<P paraDef="Body">Ytor måste vara rena och torra.</P>
